---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<Base title={"Privacy"} description={"What Northern Temper collects, which is almost nothing."} path="/privacy">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="nt-light">
      <div class="nt-wrap doc">
        <div class="nt-label">Privacy</div>
        <hr class="nt-rule" />
        <h1 class="nt-display md">Privacy</h1>
      <h3>The short version: we barely collect anything, and we sell nothing.</h3>
      <p class="lead">Northern Temper (<strong>northerntemper.ca</strong>) is a static information site. There are no accounts, no logins, and no tracking cookies. Last updated 13 September 2026.</p>
      <h3>Analytics</h3>
      <p>We use privacy-friendly, <strong>cookieless</strong> web analytics (<strong>Umami</strong>, and Vercel Web Analytics). They count page views and rough trends in aggregate. They do not set cookies, do not build a profile of you, and do not track you across other sites. That&#x27;s why you won&#x27;t see a cookie banner — there&#x27;s nothing to consent to.</p>
      <h3>If you join the coalition</h3>
      <p>The form at <a href="/join">/join</a> runs entirely in your browser. When you hit submit, it opens <em>your own email app</em> with a pre-filled message to <strong>jesse@northerntemper.ca</strong>. We only ever receive what you choose to send us — typically your business name, your email, a link, and a logo. We use it for one thing: to add your business to the coalition wall, with your permission. We don&#x27;t sell it, rent it, or share it. Ask us to remove you any time and we will.</p>
      <h3>Server logs &amp; hosting</h3>
      <p>The site is served by Vercel; the domain name is registered through a commercial registrar. Like all web hosts, they keep short-lived technical logs (e.g. IP address, browser type) to deliver pages and block abuse. We don&#x27;t use those logs to identify you.</p>
      <h3>Your rights</h3>
      <p>Under Canada&#x27;s <strong>PIPEDA</strong> and Québec&#x27;s <strong>Law 25</strong>, you can ask what personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Because we hold so little — really just the coalition emails people send us — that&#x27;s usually a one-line request. Email <a href="mailto:jesse@northerntemper.ca">jesse@northerntemper.ca</a>.</p>
      <h3>Children</h3>
      <p>This site is general-audience civic information and isn&#x27;t directed at children.</p>
      <p><em>Une version française de cette politique suivra. En attendant, écrivez-nous en français à <a href="mailto:jesse@northerntemper.ca">jesse@northerntemper.ca</a> — on vous répondra en français.</em></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</Base>

<style>
  .doc { max-width: 64ch; }
  .doc :global(h3) {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: var(--fw-label);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 21px);
    margin: clamp(28px, 4vh, 48px) 0 var(--space-2);
  }
  .doc :global(p) { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); max-width: none; }
  .doc :global(p.lead) { font-size: var(--type-lede); line-height: var(--lh-lede); font-weight: var(--fw-body-medium); margin: var(--space-4) 0; }
  .doc :global(a) { color: var(--nt-red); }
  .doc :global(ul) { margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-3) 1.1rem; }
  .doc :global(li) { margin-bottom: .6rem; }
</style>
